  "description": "⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐\n\n👑 This is Kingdom! 👑\n=\nA gaming community unique of its kind.\n\nQuality over quantity!\n\n⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐\n\n🏆Achievements🏆\n=\n**🥇#1 Guild (Leaderboard)**\n\n**🥇Winner of Seasons: 1, 2, 3, 7, 8**\n\n**🥇1st Guild to 100m XP**\n\n⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐\n\n⚜️ Our Guilds ⚜️\n=\n🔹**Kingdom**\n\n🔹**Kingdom II**\n\n🔹**Kingdom III**\n\n🔹**Kingdom IV**\n\n🔹**Kingdom V - cursed guild (Kingdom exclusive)**\n\n⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐\n\n⏩ JOIN REQUIREMENTS ⏪\n=\n👉 **Active daily.**\n\n👉 **Combat Level 100.**\n\n👉 **Contribution to Guild Challenges.**\n\n👉 **Proper gear and pets for Assault.**\n\n👉 **Full participation in mandatory Assaults.**\n\n👉 **Use of Discord.**\n\n⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐\n\n⚔️ ASSAULT INFO ⚔️\n=\n**📯 11:00 AM UTC Start Time**\n\n**🕗 8h Length (10h occasionally)**\n\n**🗓️ Dates and Location will be Announced**\n\n⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐\n\n💧 DAILY POOL at 11 AM UTC 💧\n=\n\n⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐\n\n✅ APPLY ON DISCORD NOW ✅\n=\nIf you wish to join our fam, applications **must** be done through discord: \n\n🎯 **https://discord.gg/9f2Ze8AD8J** 🎯\n\n\nIn-game only applications will **not** be considered. \n\n⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐\n\nWelcome to Kingdom! 🔥🔥🔥\n=\n\n⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐",
